  "description": "MSBuild integration for Wise Owl Demeanor — the original .NET obfuscator, known as Demeanor for .NET, Enterprise Edition through 5.x and shipping since 1999. Add a <PackageReference> to your .csproj and obfuscation runs as part of every build. Every Demeanor CLI option is exposed as a <Demeanor*> MSBuild property, so per-project obfuscation policy lives in the project file next to the rest of your build configuration. Per-company Enterprise licensing — one annual key, unlimited developers and build agents, no phone-home, no machine locking, no activation server. The obfuscator binary ships inside this package, so no separate tool install is required; the license key is supplied via the DEMEANOR_LICENSE environment variable.",
